@startuml
title LINGORA - DFD Detail: UC-05 Deterministic SRS
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle Learner
rectangle "4.1 Query Due Cards" as P41
rectangle "4.2 Present Review Card" as P42
rectangle "4.3 Validate Recall Result" as P43
rectangle "4.4 record_review Atomic Update" as P44
database "D1 Vocabulary" as Vocabulary
database "D2 UserVocabSrs" as Srs
database "D3 ReviewLog" as Logs

Learner --> P41 : open review
P41 --> Srs : own cards where nextReviewAt <= now
Srs --> P41 : due-card state
P41 --> Vocabulary : vocabulary lookup
Vocabulary --> P42 : term, meaning and media reference
P42 --> Learner : review card
Learner --> P43 : recall result
P43 --> P44 : validated result and authenticated identity
P44 --> Logs : insert immutable event
P44 --> Srs : update interval/ease/next review
Srs --> P44 : committed card state
P44 --> Learner : next schedule or retryable error
@enduml
